      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Withdrawal of oral estrogen therapy is associated with a deterioration in endothelial function in postmenopausal women with coronary artery disease. Our data also suggest that withdrawal of estrogen results in enhanced hyperemic flow, although this observation will require validation with further study."},
